      "en": "X-RAY TECHNIQUE(investigating or analysing materials by the use of X-rays <b>G01N23/00</b>; apparatus for X-ray photography <b>G03B42/02</b>; X-ray tubes <b>H01J35/00</b>; TV systems having X-ray input <b>H04N5/321</b>)",
